=\"Turn a plain-English brief into a structured project plan in seconds. Phases, tasks, owners, milestones, team, risks. Free, no signup.\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/ai-project-plan/\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\"/><meta property=\"og:image:alt\" content=\"PYNGYN: Clientspace, a standalone branded client portal, and Workspace, a standalone back office for professional-services firms\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@Pyngyn_Official\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"PYNGYN: The operating system for professional-services firms\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Run your firm and every client engagement in one place. The operating system for professional-services firms.\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://pyngyn.ai/og.png\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.png\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-icon.png\"/><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-organization\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"legalName\":\"VIMOVI GlobalTech Private Limited\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/logo.png\",\"width\":512,\"height\":512},\"image\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/icon.png\",\"description\":\"PYNGYN gives every client a branded Client Space (a standalone portal for status, documents, and approvals), with Workspace, the firm's back office for projects, finances, and billable time, available on its own or bundled together.\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://x.com/Pyngyn_Official\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/pyngyn/\",\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Pyngyn_Official/\",\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61584474731354\",\"https://www.youtube.com/@PyngynOfficial\",\"https://instagram.com/pyngyn_official\"],\"contactPoint\":[{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"customer support\",\"email\":\"support@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/support\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]},{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"sales\",\"email\":\"sales@pyngyn.com\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/demo\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"English\"]}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\" id=\"ld-website\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\",\"name\":\"PYNGYN\",\"description\":\"The operating system for professional-services firms. Run your firm and every client engagement in one place.\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#organization\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"font-sans\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><a href=\"#main\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:left-4 focus:top-4 focus:z-[200] focus:rounded-lg focus:bg-accent focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-white\">Skip to content</a><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/ai-project-plan#webpage\",\"url\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/ai-project-plan\",\"name\":\"Free Engagement Plan Generator | PYNGYN\",\"description\":\"Describe your project in plain English and get a complete plan in seconds: phases, tasks, owners, milestones, a suggested team, risks, and cadence.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/#website\"},\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/ai-project-plan#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/ai-project-plan#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Tools\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Engagement Plan Generator\",\"item\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/ai-project-plan\"}]},{\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"@id\":\"https://pyngyn.ai/tools/ai-project-plan#faq\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the Engagement Plan Generator free?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. It is free to use with no signup or credit card. Generate as many plans as you like and export them to Markdown or CSV.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What kind of plan does it produce?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A structured plan with phases, tasks, effort estimates, owners by role, milestones, a suggested team composition, the top risks with mitigations, and a recommended meeting cadence.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is this built for?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It is tuned for professional-services and consulting work: client engagements, implementations, migrations, audits, and internal initiatives at mid-market firms.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I edit or export the plan?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Copy the plan as Markdown, download it as a Markdown file, or export the task list as a CSV you can open in any spreadsheet.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How is this different from using PYNGYN?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"This tool gives you a static starting draft. In PYNGYN, the same plan becomes a living project: assignable tasks, owners, timelines, and status that update automatically as work happens. Book a demo to see it run.\"}}]}]}</script><header class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-[100] border-b transition-all duration-300 border-transparent bg-transparent\"><div class=\"wrap flex h-[68px] items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"flex items-center\" aria-label=\"pyngyn home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"pyngyn\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logo.webp\"/></a><div class=\"hidden h-full lg:flex lg:items-center\"><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-7 text-[15px] text-[#3a3a42]\"><a class=\"py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent\" href=\"/clientspace/\">Clientspace</a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Product<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Solutions<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Resources<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 py-2 transition-colors hover:text-accent \">Compare<svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"transition-transform duration-200 \"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button></nav></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/\" class=\"hidden text-[15px] font-semibold lg:inline \">Sign in</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"hidden px-4 py-2.5 lg:inline-flex btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"hidden px-[18px] py-2.5 lg:inline-flex btn btn-primary\">Book a demo</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-lg border lg:hidden border-line bg-white text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"wrap pb-[10px] pt-[140px] text-center\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Free tool</span><h1 class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[820px] font-display text-[clamp(34px,5vw,58px)] font-semibold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.025em]\">Turn a brief into a project plan in seconds.</h1><p class=\"lead mx-auto mt-5\">Describe the work in plain language. Get phases, tasks, owners, milestones, a suggested team, the top risks, and a meeting cadence. Free, no signup, export anywhere.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>No signup</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Export to Markdown / CSV</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Built for services firms</span></div></section><div class=\"pt-12\"><div class=\"wrap pb-[80px]\"><div class=\"grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-[420px_1fr]\"><aside class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-[88px] lg:self-start\"><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-white p-6 shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Describe your project</div><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-display text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">Tell us about the work.</h2><div class=\"mt-5 space-y-4\"><label class=\"block\"><div class=\"mb-1.5 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Project name</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-muted\">What is this engagement called?</span></div><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. Acme CRM rollout\" maxLength=\"120\" class=\"input\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"block\"><div class=\"mb-1.5 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Engagement type</span></div><select class=\"input select-chevron appearance-none bg-white pr-9\"><option value=\"Client engagement\" selected=\"\">Client engagement</option><option value=\"Audit &amp; assessment\">Audit &amp; assessment</option><option value=\"Advisory project\">Advisory project</option><option value=\"Client onboarding\">Client onboarding</option><option value=\"Litigation matter\">Litigation matter</option><option value=\"Retainer / ongoing\">Retainer / ongoing</option><option value=\"Internal initiative\">Internal initiative</option></select></label><label class=\"block\"><div class=\"mb-1.5 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Industry</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-muted\">Optional, helps tailor language</span></div><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. Financial services\" maxLength=\"80\" class=\"input\" value=\"\"/></label><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3\"><label class=\"block\"><div class=\"mb-1.5 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Timeline</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-muted\">Weeks</span></div><input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"52\" class=\"input\" value=\"8\"/></label><label class=\"block\"><div class=\"mb-1.5 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Team size</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-muted\">People</span></div><input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"50\" class=\"input\" value=\"5\"/></label></div><label class=\"block\"><div class=\"mb-1.5 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink\">Goals &amp; deliverables</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-muted\">0/1200 characters</span></div><textarea placeholder=\"What does success look like? Any constraints, dependencies, or non-negotiable dates?\" rows=\"5\" class=\"input resize-y\"></textarea></label><button type=\"button\" disabled=\"\" class=\"btn btn-primary w-full justify-center disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60\">Generate plan →</button><p class=\"text-[12px] text-muted\">Add a project name and at least a sentence about goals.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 border-t border-line pt-5\"><div class=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted\">Try an example</div><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-2.5 text-left text-[13.5px] text-ink transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:bg-accent-lt\">M&amp;A due diligence for a client</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-2.5 text-left text-[13.5px] text-ink transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:bg-accent-lt\">Year-end audit for a client</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-xl border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-2.5 text-left text-[13.5px] text-ink transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:bg-accent-lt\">New client onboarding</button></div></div></div></aside><section id=\"plan-output\" class=\"min-h-[420px]\"><div class=\"grid h-full min-h-[420px] place-items-center rounded-[22px] border border-dashed border-line bg-white p-10 text-center\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"max-w-[440px]\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-accent-lt text-accent\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4M6 6l2.5 2.5M15.5 15.5L18 18M18 6l-2.5 2.5M8.5 15.5L6 18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em]\">Your plan will appear here.</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] text-muted\">Fill in the form and tap Generate. We will return phases, tasks, owners, milestones, a suggested team, top risks, and a cadence.</p><ul class=\"mt-5 grid gap-2 text-left text-[13.5px] text-muted\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-1 grid h-4 w-4 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent-lt text-accent\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>Built for professional services and consulting work</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-1 grid h-4 w-4 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent-lt text-accent\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>Outputs are editable Markdown, CSV, or copy-paste</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"mt-1 grid h-4 w-4 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent-lt text-accent\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>Free, no signup required</li></ul></div></div></section></div><div class=\"mt-16 overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] border border-line bg-gradient-to-br from-accent-lt via-white to-canvas p-8 lg:p-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between\"><div><div class=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent\">Want this as a live, running project?</div><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-display text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] lg:text-[32px]\">Build this plan in PYNGYN. Watch it stay current.</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-[560px] text-[15px] text-muted\">In PYNGYN, the same plan becomes assignable tasks, owners, timelines, and live status, updated automatically as work happens.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book a demo</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a></div></div></div></div></div><section class=\"section-tight\"><div class=\"wrap max-w-[820px]\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>How it works</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3\">From plain English to a working plan.</h2><div class=\"mt-6 space-y-4 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><p>Scoping a new engagement usually means a blank document, a few reference decks, and an hour of staring before the structure appears. This generator removes the blank-page problem. You tell it what the work is, how long you have, and who is on the team, and it returns a plan you can react to instead of one you have to invent.</p><p>The output follows the shape professional-services teams already use: a discovery phase that locks scope, a design phase that earns sign-off, a build phase that does the work, and a rollout phase that lands adoption. Each phase carries tasks with effort estimates, an owning role, and a milestone that defines done. You also get a staffing suggestion, the three risks most likely to derail the work, and a cadence so the team stays aligned.</p><p>Treat it as a first draft, not the final word. Edit the Markdown, drop the task CSV into your spreadsheet, or bring it into PYNGYN where the plan becomes a living project that updates itself as work moves.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>FAQ</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3\">Questions, answered.</h2><dl class=\"mt-6 divide-y divide-line\"><div class=\"py-5\"><dt class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\">Is the Engagement Plan Generator free?</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Yes. It is free to use with no signup or credit card. Generate as many plans as you like and export them to Markdown or CSV.</dd></div><div class=\"py-5\"><dt class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\">What kind of plan does it produce?</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">A structured plan with phases, tasks, effort estimates, owners by role, milestones, a suggested team composition, the top risks with mitigations, and a recommended meeting cadence.</dd></div><div class=\"py-5\"><dt class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\">Who is this built for?</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">It is tuned for professional-services and consulting work: client engagements, implementations, migrations, audits, and internal initiatives at mid-market firms.</dd></div><div class=\"py-5\"><dt class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\">Can I edit or export the plan?</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Yes. Copy the plan as Markdown, download it as a Markdown file, or export the task list as a CSV you can open in any spreadsheet.</dd></div><div class=\"py-5\"><dt class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\">How is this different from using PYNGYN?</dt><dd class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">This tool gives you a static starting draft. In PYNGYN, the same plan becomes a living project: assignable tasks, owners, timelines, and status that update automatically as work happens. Book a demo to see it run.</dd></div></dl></div></div></section><section class=\"section-tight\"><div class=\"wrap max-w-[820px]\"><div class=\"rounded-[22px] border border-accent/30 bg-accent-lt px-7 py-9 sm:px-9\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>From this tool to your firm</span><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[26px]\">Turn this plan into tasks with owners, deadlines, and a client who can see it.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[640px] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Workspace turns this draft into a real project: owners, deadlines, and AI keeping status current as work moves. Add Clientspace and the client watching this engagement sees progress in their own branded portal, no separate update required.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-accent\">Start free trial<!-- --> →</a><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-ghost bg-white\">Book a demo</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"demo\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-line bg-white px-7 py-[72px] text-center shadow-card\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 left-1/2 h-[420px] w-[420px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-accent-lt opacity-70 blur-[80px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><span class=\"eyebrow relative\">Ready when you are</span><h2 class=\"title relative mx-auto mt-3.5 max-w-[680px] text-[clamp(30px,4.4vw,48px)]\">Stop managing the tool. Start shipping the work.</h2><p class=\"lead relative mx-auto mt-[18px]\">See PYNGYN run a real project in 30 minutes, and let AI handle the project management busywork.</p><div class=\"relative mt-[30px] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book a demo →</a><a href=\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\">Start free</a></div><p class=\"relative mt-4 text-sm text-muted\">30-minute walkthrough · Tailored to your team · No commitment</p></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-white pt-16 pb-10 text-sm text-muted\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_repeat(5,1fr)]\"><div><a class=\"mb-4 inline-block\" aria-label=\"pyngyn home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"pyngyn\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logo.webp\"/></a><p class=\"max-w-[230px] leading-relaxed\">The operating system for professional-services firms.</p><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.pyngyn.io&amp;hl=en_IN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-xl border border-line bg-white px-4 py-2.5 transition-colors hover:border-accent\" aria-label=\"Get PYNGYN on Google Play\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.6 2.3 13 12 3.6 21.7a1.4 1.4 0 0 1-.6-1.2V3.5c0-.5.2-.9.6-1.2z\" fill=\"#34a853\"></path><path d=\"M16.8 8.6 13 12 3.6 2.3c.4-.3.9-.3 1.4 0l8.8 5z\" fill=\"#ea4335\"></path><path d=\"M16.8 15.4 5 22c-.5.3-1 .3-1.4 0L13 12z\" fill=\"#fbbc04\"></path><path d=\"m16.8 8.6 4 2.3c.7.4.7 1.4 0 1.8l-4 2.7L13 12z\" fill=\"#4285f4\"></path></