 bring it into PYNGYN where the plan becomes a living project that updates itself as work moves.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow-dot\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\"FAQ\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"title mt-3\",\"children\":\"Questions, answered.\"}],[\"$\",\"dl\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 divide-y divide-line\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"Is the Engagement Plan Generator free?\",{\"className\":\"py-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Is the Engagement Plan Generator free?\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"Yes. It is free to use with no signup or credit card. Generate as many plans as you like and export them to Markdown or CSV.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"What kind of plan does it produce?\",{\"className\":\"py-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"What kind of plan does it produce?\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"A structured plan with phases, tasks, effort estimates, owners by role, milestones, a suggested team composition, the top risks with mitigations, and a recommended meeting cadence.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Who is this built for?\",{\"className\":\"py-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Who is this built for?\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"It is tuned for professional-services and consulting work: client engagements, implementations, migrations, audits, and internal initiatives at mid-market firms.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Can I edit or export the plan?\",{\"className\":\"py-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"