className\":\"mt-6 space-y-4 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Scoping a new engagement usually means a blank document, a few reference decks, and an hour of staring before the structure appears. This generator removes the blank-page problem. You tell it what the work is, how long you have, and who is on the team, and it returns a plan you can react to instead of one you have to invent.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The output follows the shape professional-services teams already use: a discovery phase that locks scope, a design phase that earns sign-off, a build phase that does the work, and a rollout phase that lands adoption. Each phase carries tasks with effort estimates, an owning role, and a milestone that defines done. You also get a staffing suggestion, the three risks most likely to derail the work, and a cadence so the team stays aligned.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Treat it as a first draft, not the final word. Edit the Markdown, drop the task CSV into your spreadsheet, or bring it into PYNGYN where the plan becomes a living project that updates itself as work moves.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow-dot\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\"FAQ\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"title mt-3\",\"children\":\"Questions, answered.\"}],[\"$\",\"dl\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 divide-y divide-line\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"Is the Engagement Plan Generator free?\",{\"className\":\"py-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Is the Engagement Plan Generator free?\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"Yes. It is free to use with no signup or credit card. Generate as many plans as you like and export them to Markdown or CSV.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"What kind of plan does it produce?\",{\"className\":\"py-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"What kind of plan does it produce?\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"A structured plan with phases, tasks, effort estimates, owners by role, milestones, a suggested team composition, the top risks with mitigations, and a recommended meeting cadence.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Who is this built for?\",{\"className\":\"py-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Who is this built for?\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"It is tuned for professional-services and consulting work: client engagements, implementations, migrations, audits, and internal initiatives at mid-market firms.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Can I edit or export the plan?\",{\"className\":\"py-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"Can I edit or export the plan?\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"Yes. Copy the plan as Markdown, download it as a Markdown file, or export the task list as a CSV you can open in any spreadsheet.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"How is this different from using PYNGYN?\",{\"className\":\"py-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[17px] font-semibold text-ink\",\"children\":\"How is this different from using PYNGYN?\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"This tool gives you a static starting draft. In PYNGYN, the same plan becomes a living project: assignable tasks, owners, timelines, and status that update automatically as work happens. Book a demo to see it run.\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"section-tight\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap max-w-[820px]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-[22px] border border-accent/30 bg-accent-lt px-7 py-9 sm:px-9\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"eyebrow-dot\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\"From this tool to your firm\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold leading-snug tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[26px]\",\"children\":\"Turn this plan into tasks with owners, deadlines, and a client who can see it.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 max-w-[640px] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\",\"children\":\"Workspace turns this draft into a real project: owners, deadlines, and AI keeping status current as work moves. Add Clientspace and the client watching this engagement sees progress in their own branded portal, no separate update required.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://app.pyngyn.ai/?signup=true\",\"className\":\"btn btn-accent\",\"children\":[\"Start free trial\",\" →\"]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/demo\",\"className\":\"btn btn-ghost bg-white\",\"children\":\"Book a demo\"}]]}]]}]}]}]\na:[\"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$L1f\",null,{}]\nc:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/13zu_dotr70kl.js\",\"async\":true}]\nd:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-1\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/1_p0c8_mtfqqv.js\",\"async\":true}]\ne:[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-2\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/41mnvtr75by45.js\",\"async\":true}]\nf:[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$21\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@22\"}]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L23\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\